mbo.spell.magic_missile=Magic Missile
mbo.spell.magic_missile.desc=Fires a bolt of magical energy in the direction you are pointing.
mbo.spell.snowball=Snowball
mbo.spell.snowball.desc=Launches a snowball in the direction you are pointing.
mbo.spell.heal=Heal
mbo.spell.heal.desc=Heals the caster by 2 hearts.
mbo.spell.heal_ally=Heal Ally
mbo.spell.heal_ally.desc=Heals the targeted creature by 2 and a half hearts.
mbo.spell.replenish_hunger=Replenish Hunger
mbo.spell.replenish_hunger.desc=Restores 6 hunger points to the caster.
mbo.spell.cure_effects=Cure Effects
mbo.spell.cure_effects.desc=Removes every active potion effect from the caster.
mbo.spell.conjure_sword=Conjure Sword
mbo.spell.conjure_sword.desc=Creates a temporary spectral sword with iron weapon strength.
mbo.spell.conjure_pickaxe=Conjure Pickaxe
mbo.spell.conjure_pickaxe.desc=Creates a temporary spectral pickaxe with iron tool strength.
mbo.spell.conjure_bow=Conjure Bow
mbo.spell.conjure_bow.desc=Creates a temporary spectral bow with unlimited arrows.
mbo.spell.flaming_axe=Flaming Axe
mbo.spell.flaming_axe.desc=Creates a temporary axe that sets struck creatures on fire.
mbo.spell.frost_axe=Frost Axe
mbo.spell.frost_axe.desc=Creates a temporary axe that freezes struck creatures.
mbo.spell.firebolt=Firebolt
mbo.spell.firebolt.desc=Shoots a jet of fire a short distance in front of you.
mbo.spell.ice_shard=Ice Shard
mbo.spell.ice_shard.desc=Fires a shard of ice which damages and slows its target.
mbo.spell.thunderbolt=Thunderbolt
mbo.spell.thunderbolt.desc=Shoots a bolt of thunder which knocks back targets.
enchantment.mbo.imbuement=Imbuement
enchantment.mbo.flamingWeapon=Fire Imbuement
enchantment.mbo.freezingWeapon=Frost Imbuement
mbo.spell.imbue_weapon=Imbue Weapon
mbo.spell.imbue_weapon.desc=Temporarily imbues the first weapon on the caster's hotbar with magic, rendering it more effective. The magic wears off after 45 seconds.
mbo.spell.flaming_weapon=Flaming Weapon
mbo.spell.flaming_weapon.desc=Temporarily imbues the first weapon on the caster's hotbar with the power of flame, causing it to set fire to its victims. The magic wears off after 45 seconds.
mbo.spell.freezing_weapon=Freezing Weapon
mbo.spell.freezing_weapon.desc=Temporarily imbues the first weapon on the caster's hotbar with the power of frost, causing it to freeze its victims. The magic wears off after 45 seconds.
mbo.spell.fire_resistance=Fire Resistance
mbo.spell.fire_resistance.desc=Grants the caster fire resistance for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.fireskin=Fireskin
mbo.spell.fireskin.desc=Cloaks the caster in flames for 30 seconds, causing anything that attacks them to catch fire.
mbo.spell.ice_shroud=Ice Shroud
mbo.spell.ice_shroud.desc=Creates a shroud of cold around the caster for 30 seconds, causing anything that attacks them to be frozen.
mbo.spell.static_aura=Static Aura
mbo.spell.static_aura.desc=Surrounds the caster with lightning for 30 seconds, firing a spark of lightning at anything that hits them.
mbo.spell.water_breathing=Water Breathing
mbo.spell.water_breathing.desc=Allows the caster to breathe underwater for 60 seconds.
mbo.spell.invisibility=Invisibility
mbo.spell.invisibility.desc=Makes the caster invisible for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.sixth_sense=Sixth Sense
mbo.spell.sixth_sense.desc=Allows the caster to sense the locations of nearby creatures, even through walls, for 20 seconds.
mbo.spell.transience=Transience
mbo.spell.transience.desc=Makes the caster transient for 20 seconds. The caster is immune to all damage while transient but cannot break or place blocks or cause any damage.
mbo.spell.darkvision=Darkvision
mbo.spell.darkvision.desc=Grants the caster night vision for 45 seconds.
mbo.spell.oakflesh=Oakflesh
mbo.spell.oakflesh.desc=Improves the caster's damage resistance for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.ironflesh=Ironflesh
mbo.spell.ironflesh.desc=Greatly improves the caster's damage resistance for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.diamondflesh=Diamondflesh
mbo.spell.diamondflesh.desc=Grants the caster extreme damage resistance for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.ignite=Ignite
mbo.spell.ignite.desc=Sets the target on fire for 10 seconds. Also works like a flint and steel.
mbo.spell.freeze=Freeze
mbo.spell.freeze.desc=Freezes the target for 10 seconds. Will also freeze water and create snow on the ground.
mbo.spell.poison=Poison
mbo.spell.poison.desc=Fires poison in the direction you are pointing.
mbo.spell.wither=Wither
mbo.spell.wither.desc=Fires a ray of darkness which withers anything it touches.
mbo.spell.arcane_jammer=Arcane Jammer
mbo.spell.arcane_jammer.desc=Prevents the target from using magic for 15 seconds.
mbo.spell.mind_trick=Mind Trick
mbo.spell.mind_trick.desc=Confuses the target for 15 seconds, rendering it unable to attack effectively.
mbo.spell.intimidate=Intimidate
mbo.spell.intimidate.desc=Causes nearby creatures to run away in fear for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.life_drain=Life Drain
mbo.spell.life_drain.desc=Drains the target's life and gradually restores the caster's health.
mbo.spell.agility=Agility
mbo.spell.agility.desc=Increases the caster's movement speed and jump height for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.greater_heal=Greater Heal
mbo.spell.greater_heal.desc=Heals the caster by 4 hearts.
mbo.spell.group_heal=Group Heal
mbo.spell.group_heal.desc=Heals the caster and nearby allies by 3 hearts.
mbo.spell.leap=Leap
mbo.spell.leap.desc=Launches the caster forwards and upwards.
mbo.spell.whirlwind=Whirlwind
mbo.spell.whirlwind.desc=Creates a powerful gust of wind which throws the target away.
mbo.spell.banish=Banish
mbo.spell.banish.desc=Teleports the target to a random location nearby.
mbo.spell.mind_control=Mind Control
mbo.spell.mind_control.desc=Temporarily takes control of a creature and turns it against nearby enemies.
mbo.spell.force_orb=Force Orb
mbo.spell.force_orb.desc=Launches an orb of force which explodes on impact, damaging and throwing nearby creatures.
mbo.spell.ice_charge=Ice Charge
mbo.spell.ice_charge.desc=Launches a ball of ice which freezes nearby creatures and releases shards on impact.
mbo.spell.fireball=Fireball
mbo.spell.fireball.desc=Launches a fireball which damages and ignites its target.
mbo.spell.greater_fireball=Greater Fireball
mbo.spell.greater_fireball.desc=Launches a large fireball which explodes on impact.
mbo.spell.dart=Dart
mbo.spell.dart.desc=Fires a poisoned dart which weakens its target.
mbo.spell.force_arrow=Force Arrow
mbo.spell.force_arrow.desc=Fires a fast arrow of magical force.
mbo.spell.ice_lance=Ice Lance
mbo.spell.ice_lance.desc=Fires a piercing lance of ice which damages and freezes its targets.
mbo.spell.lightning_arrow=Lightning Arrow
mbo.spell.lightning_arrow.desc=Fires an arrow of lightning which can charge creepers.
mbo.spell.darkness_orb=Darkness Orb
mbo.spell.darkness_orb.desc=Launches a slow orb of darkness which damages and withers its target.
mbo.spell.firebomb=Firebomb
mbo.spell.firebomb.desc=Throws a bomb which burns creatures around its impact point.
mbo.spell.poison_bomb=Poison Bomb
mbo.spell.poison_bomb.desc=Throws a bomb which poisons creatures around its impact point.
mbo.spell.smoke_bomb=Smoke Bomb
mbo.spell.smoke_bomb.desc=Throws a smoke bomb which blinds players and confuses creatures.
mbo.spell.spark_bomb=Spark Bomb
mbo.spell.spark_bomb.desc=Throws an electrical bomb which strikes up to four nearby creatures.
mbo.spell.homing_spark=Homing Spark
mbo.spell.homing_spark.desc=Launches an electrical spark which seeks out a nearby target.
mbo.spell.lightning_disc=Lightning Disc
mbo.spell.lightning_disc.desc=Launches a wide spinning disc of lightning which can strike multiple targets.
mbo.spell.wither_skull=Wither Skull
mbo.spell.wither_skull.desc=Launches an explosive wither skull in the direction you are pointing.
mbo.spell.fire_sigil=Fire Sigil
mbo.spell.fire_sigil.desc=Places a hidden fire trap on the ground which burns the first enemy to step on it.
mbo.spell.frost_sigil=Frost Sigil
mbo.spell.frost_sigil.desc=Places a hidden frost trap on the ground which damages and freezes the first enemy to step on it.
mbo.spell.lightning_sigil=Lightning Sigil
mbo.spell.lightning_sigil.desc=Places a hidden lightning trap which strikes its victim and up to three nearby enemies.
mbo.spell.snare=Snare
mbo.spell.snare.desc=Sets a trap on the ground which damages and briefly slows the creature that triggers it.
tile.magicSnare.name=Snare
mbo.spell.arc=Arc
mbo.spell.arc.desc=Fires a spark of lightning at the target.
mbo.spell.chain_lightning=Chain Lightning
mbo.spell.chain_lightning.desc=Fires a spark of lightning at the target, which then chains to additional targets up to twice.
mbo.spell.lightning_bolt=Lightning Bolt
mbo.spell.lightning_bolt.desc=Causes lightning to strike where you are pointing.
mbo.spell.lightning_ray=Lightning Ray
mbo.spell.lightning_ray.desc=Creates a stream of lightning in the direction you are pointing which continually damages targets.
mbo.spell.lightning_web=Lightning Web
mbo.spell.lightning_web.desc="Focus. Channel the storm in your mind through your wand and unleash its fury."
mbo.spell.lightning_pulse=Lightning Pulse
mbo.spell.lightning_pulse.desc=Charges the ground around the caster with lightning, damaging and repelling nearby creatures.
mbo.spell.flame_ray=Flame Ray
mbo.spell.flame_ray.desc=Creates a stream of flames in the direction you are pointing which sets on fire and continually damages targets.
mbo.spell.frost_ray=Frost Ray
mbo.spell.frost_ray.desc=Creates a stream of frost in the direction you are pointing which slows and continually damages targets.
mbo.spell.firestorm=Firestorm
mbo.spell.firestorm.desc="I am the dragon."
mbo.spell.blink=Blink
mbo.spell.blink.desc=Teleports the caster over a short distance to where they are pointing.
mbo.spell.phase_step=Phase Step
mbo.spell.phase_step.desc=Teleports the caster through a 1 block thick wall in front of them. Range upgrades will increase the thickness you can teleport through.
mbo.spell.glide=Glide
mbo.spell.glide.desc=Allows the caster to glide downwards while in the air and holding the use item button.
mbo.spell.levitation=Levitation
mbo.spell.levitation.desc=Raises the caster upwards while the use item button is held. Will also negate fall damage if used before hitting the ground.
mbo.spell.flight=Flight
mbo.spell.flight.desc=Soar like an eagle.
mbo.spell.black_hole=Black Hole
mbo.spell.black_hole.desc=Tear reality asunder.
mbo.spell.petrify=Petrify
mbo.spell.petrify.desc=Turns the target to stone until broken out, with a chance for it to break out when it is dark. The target cannot move or do anything while petrified but is also impervious to all damage.
mbo.spell.detonate=Detonate
mbo.spell.detonate.desc=Causes an explosion at the targeted point, damaging all nearby creatures, including the caster.
mbo.spell.pocket_furnace=Pocket Furnace
mbo.spell.pocket_furnace.desc=Smelts up to 5 smeltable items in the caster's inventory. Hotbar items are smelted first.
mbo.spell.invoke_weather=Invoke Weather
mbo.spell.invoke_weather.desc=Changes the weather in the overworld.
mbo.spell.invoke_weather.sun=The sky clears.
mbo.spell.invoke_weather.rain=Rain begins.
mbo.spell.cobwebs=Cobwebs
mbo.spell.cobwebs.desc=Creates cobwebs at the targeted point. They greatly slow creatures and vanish after 20 seconds or when broken.
mbo.spell.wall_of_frost=Wall of Frost
mbo.spell.wall_of_frost.desc=Creates a temporary wall of ice at the targeted point.
mbo.spell.ring_of_fire=Ring of Fire
mbo.spell.ring_of_fire.desc=Creates a ring of fire around the caster, damaging all nearby enemies and setting them on fire.
mbo.spell.decay=Decay
mbo.spell.decay.desc=Creates patches of decay on the ground that infect creatures which touch them.
mbo.spell.bubble=Bubble
mbo.spell.bubble.desc=Fires a jet of bubbles which causes anything it hits to float upwards helplessly. The target will fall after a certain time or if it is damaged.
mbo.spell.entrapment=Entrapment
mbo.spell.entrapment.desc=Traps the target in a sphere of darkness which pulls it helplessly upwards and continually damages it.
mbo.spell.light=Light
mbo.spell.light.desc=Creates a magical point of light which illuminates the surrounding area. Lasts for 30 seconds.
mbo.spell.growth_aura=Growth Aura
mbo.spell.growth_aura.desc=Grows all crops near the caster. Also grows tall grass and flowers on grass.
mbo.spell.invigorating_presence=Invigorating Presence
mbo.spell.invigorating_presence.desc=Grants the caster and all nearby allies increased strength for 45 seconds.
mbo.spell.shadow_ward=Shadow Ward
mbo.spell.shadow_ward.desc=Creates a wall of darkness in front of the caster which causes half of all incoming damage to be inflicted upon the attacker instead.
mbo.spell.shockwave=Shockwave
mbo.spell.shockwave.desc=Boom.
mbo.spell.shield=Shield
mbo.spell.shield.desc=Creates a protective barrier of force that blocks projectiles and magic. Also grants the caster a weak resistance effect.
mbo.spell.arrow_rain=Arrow Rain
mbo.spell.arrow_rain.desc="Archers, fire!"
mbo.spell.hailstorm=Hailstorm
mbo.spell.hailstorm.desc=It was during the great winter of the third age that the ice mages discovered their true power.
mbo.spell.blizzard=Blizzard
mbo.spell.blizzard.desc=Creates a zone of swirling icy wind which slows and continually damages anything trapped inside. The caster is immune to the damage but is still slowed.
mbo.spell.ice_spikes=Ice Spikes
mbo.spell.ice_spikes.desc=Causes razor-sharp ice spikes to rise from the ground where you are pointing, skewering any creatures caught amongst them.
mbo.spell.ice_age=Ice Age
mbo.spell.ice_age.desc="You shall be frozen for an eternity!"
mbo.spell.ice_statue=Ice Statue
mbo.spell.ice_statue.desc=Freezes the target solid for 20 seconds or until broken out. The target cannot move or do anything while frozen but is also impervious to all damage.
mbo.spell.forcefield=Forcefield
mbo.spell.forcefield.desc=Creates a forcefield around the caster which repels creatures and deflects projectiles.
mbo.spell.healing_aura=Healing Aura
mbo.spell.healing_aura.desc=Creates a zone of healing energy which regenerates the health of any ally inside it. Any undead inside the healing aura will slowly take damage.
mbo.spell.thunderstorm=Thunderstorm
mbo.spell.thunderstorm.desc="Mwahahahahahaha!"
mbo.spell.meteor=Meteor
mbo.spell.meteor.desc=Some wizards just want to see the world burn...
mbo.spell.clairvoyance=Clairvoyance
mbo.spell.clairvoyance.desc=Reveals the path to a remembered location. Sneak-cast while looking at a block to remember it.
mbo.spell.clairvoyance.saved=Clairvoyance destination saved: %s, %s, %s
mbo.spell.clairvoyance.undefined=Sneak and use the scroll while looking at a block first.
mbo.spell.clairvoyance.wrong_dimension=The saved destination is in another dimension.
mbo.spell.clairvoyance.no_path=No path to the saved destination could be found.
mbo.spell.curse_of_soulbinding=Curse of Soulbinding
mbo.spell.curse_of_soulbinding.desc=All damage dealt to the caster is also dealt to the victim.
mbo.spell.decoy=Decoy
mbo.spell.decoy.desc=Creates an illusory clone which tricks mobs into attacking it.
mbo.spell.earthquake=Earthquake
mbo.spell.earthquake.desc=A true master of earth magic can move mountains.
mbo.spell.forests_curse=Forest's Curse
mbo.spell.forests_curse.desc="How dare you enter my forest!"
mbo.spell.lightning_hammer=Lightning Hammer
mbo.spell.lightning_hammer.desc="I smite you by the wrath of the heavens!"
mbo.spell.metamorphosis=Metamorphosis
mbo.spell.metamorphosis.desc=Changes the target into another form. Only works on some creatures.
mbo.spell.plague_of_darkness=Plague of Darkness
mbo.spell.plague_of_darkness.desc=The darkness will consume them all...
mbo.spell.spectral_pathway=Spectral Pathway
mbo.spell.spectral_pathway.desc=Creates a temporary magical bridge in front of you.
mbo.spell.telekinesis=Telekinesis
mbo.spell.telekinesis.desc=Moves an item towards you, activates a block at range or disarms a player.
mbo.spell.tornado=Tornado
mbo.spell.tornado.desc=Unleashes a tornado which hurls anything in its path skyward.
mbo.spell.summon_spirit_horse=Summon Spirit Horse
mbo.spell.summon_spirit_horse.desc=Summons a spirit horse for you to ride. It vanishes shortly after being dismounted, or when dismissed by sneak-right-clicking it with an empty hand.
entity.mbo.spirit_horse.name=Spirit Horse
